\begin{restatable}{lemma}{detMax}\label{lem:detMax}
There is a deterministic algorithm which, given a capacitated $h$-layer $S$-$T$ DAG $D$, computes an integral $S$-$T$ flow that is blocking in:
\begin{enumerate}
